    25	# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ the key
    26	# The window's kms key already exists (kms_key_id); this module never creates one. (The provider pinned here,
    27	# hashicorp/aws 5.100, does not accept customer_master_key_spec = "ML_DSA_65", so a new key is made outside
    28	# Terraform, and is a new window key: new key assertion, new DNS record.)
